        ],
        "exact_text": "he unclipped the line from his harness and let it fall away with the bridge",
        "reason": "Spine has him cut the line to free himself; the prose says unclipped, which weakens the climactic sacrifice."
      },
      {
        "family": "narrative_coherence",
        "severity": "minor",
